# Workshop Energy Cost Estimator

## What it does
This program helps workshop owners calculate the daily and monthly electricity cost of their machines. The user enters the number of machines, their names, power ratings (in watts), and hours of use per day. It then calculates energy consumption in kWh and the total cost based on the local tariff in Naira.

